# Celestial Themes — browser support floor (single source of truth).
#
# Pinned by color-mix() usage throughout the skin/color system, whose baseline is
# Chrome 111 / Safari 16.4 / Firefox 113 (~mid-2023). Supporting older would mean
# removing color-mix() from the color engine. Autoprefixer + downstream tooling read
# this file. Revisit when the engine drops/changes its modern-CSS dependencies.
Chrome >= 111
Edge >= 111
Firefox >= 113
Safari >= 16.4
iOS >= 16.4
